## 📊 Superstore Sales Dashboard (Power BI)

## 📌 Project Overview  
This project is an **interactive Power BI dashboard** built using the Superstore dataset.  
It provides insights into sales performance, profit trends, customer behavior, and regional analysis to support business decision-making.

---

## 🎯 Objectives  
- Analyze overall sales and profit performance  
- Identify top-performing categories and sub-categories  
- Track monthly sales and profit trends (Year-over-Year)  
- Understand customer segments and payment modes  
- Visualize regional and state-wise sales distribution  

---

## 📂 Dataset  
- Superstore Dataset  
- Includes: Orders, Sales, Profit, Quantity, Category, Sub-Category, Region, Payment Mode  

---

## 🛠️ Tools & Technologies  
- Power BI  
- SQL (Basic)  
- Microsoft Excel  

---

## 📈 Key Insights  

### 🔹 KPIs  
- **Total Sales:** 522K  
- **Total Profit:** 68K  
- **Total Quantity:** 7298  
- **Average Delivery Time:** 9 days  

### 🔹 Sales Analysis  
- Monthly Sales Trend (YoY)  
- Sales by Category and Sub-Category  
- Sales by Region and State  

### 🔹 Profit Analysis  
- Monthly Profit Trend (YoY)  

### 🔹 Customer Insights  
- Sales by Segment (Consumer, Corporate, Home Office)  

### 🔹 Operational Insights  
- Sales by Ship Mode  
- Sales by Payment Mode (COD, Online, Cards)  

---

## 🌍 Dashboard Features  
- Interactive filters (Region: Central, East, South, West)  
- Dynamic and user-friendly visuals  
- Map visualization for geographical analysis  

